================================================================
MACHINE LEARNING MODEL
================================================================

Verité's toxicity classifier is built on the following chain of work:

1. Base model - "bert-mini" (prajjwal1/bert-mini)
   Author: Prajjwal Bhargava (Hugging Face: prajjwal1)
   License: MIT License
   https://huggingface.co/prajjwal1/bert-mini

2. Fine-tuned & quantized toxicity model - "bert-tiny-toxicity"
   Author: Gravitee.io
   Fine-tuning and quantization performed by Gravitee.io on the base model
   above, trained for multilingual toxicity detection.
   License: CreativeML Open RAIL++-M License (dated July 26, 2023).
   The text of that license is Copyright (c) 2023 Stability AI; it governs
   the fine-tuned model but does not imply Stability AI authored the model.
   https://huggingface.co/gravitee-io/bert-tiny-toxicity

Verité applies further modifications to this model (re-housing the weights,
vocabulary, and tokenizer configuration into its own binary asset format and
running inference through an in-house forward pass). The original copyright,
license, and NOTICE terms continue to apply and are shipped unchanged in the
models directory (see LICENSE and NOTICE).

Support the original creators:
  https://huggingface.co/prajjwal1/bert-mini
  https://huggingface.co/gravitee-io/bert-tiny-toxicity


